4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jOgqjMvO5u8Q7kNvwEqpHHc&_nc_oc=AdoX67euH9vI63wr46GxwLw0CjxAWgoTN266Z_e4ILiB7jfTZKxoj67_HyCSeIa8qZE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAzacxEt2aXWw_YmJXIntl3YfKzyq0LqdLmNSUAgbnvfw&oe=6A64B454"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7PkNcwgV9dAQ7kNvwF01FIE&_nc_oc=Adpa1QMEbW_XwDmyIvDOHznbtH6Lgz9b17LJfPK6l_1SUBLOPibZXnmVPfqmTuOTlUY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAWXI1nCKjpe8_hj8yAREzojxb3D3XU5ViSb0smpQl_jg&oe=6A64B932"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yhS9SAYhCqsQ7kNvwEJ5mm9&_nc_oc=AdpTGi5N2jniDWW6-lFawF19Iy81McShQMQrFWCDEFElIdZN_uZv40G2sPuPy16fWIo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCfaV8NKfU3eUPjE7CwWSKw9WyTcWiwVpGAFBtQDHcqXg&oe=6A64C6D5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p